@Auth.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Health
GET {{Auth.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Register — 202 Accepted {message}; the account is pending until the emailed link is verified
POST {{Auth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@b.com",
  "password": "SecureP@ss123",
  "fullName": "Hoai Nguyen",
  "role": "User"
}

### Register duplicate — also 202 Accepted (owner receives a notice)
POST {{Auth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@b.com",
  "password": "SecureP@ss123",
  "fullName": "Hoai Nguyen"
}

### Login — 200 {accessToken,refreshToken,user}
POST {{Auth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@b.com",
  "password": "SecureP@ss123"
}

### Login wrong — 401 Unauthorized
POST {{Auth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@b.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}
